{"id":"dolgij","lemma":"долгий","pos":"adj","rank":1893,"glosses":["long (having great duration)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a1/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B3%D0%B8%D0%B9.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B3%D0%B8%D0%B9.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"дольше","neuter":"долгое","feminine":"долгая","plural":"долгие"},"examples":[{"text":"Вы знали его долгое время?","en":"Have you known him for a long time?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"him / his"},null,{"g":"time"}]},{"text":"Я здесь дольше, чем ты.","en":"I've been here longer than you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"here"},null,{"g":"than"},{"g":"you"}]},{"text":"Похоже, день сегодня будет долгий.","en":"It looks like today will be a long day.","words":[{"g":"it seems"},{"g":"day, daytime"},{"g":"today"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Это была долгая ночь.","en":"It was a long night.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"night, nighttime"}]},{"text":"Я не могу остаться дольше.","en":"I can't stay any longer.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to remain, to stay"},null]}]}